        <rule id="eb50-00ce-bea3-5bf2" name="Army-list note" hidden="false">
          <description>Each choice includes four runners. Group multiple Salamanders into batteries in roster notes. Runner champion selection awaits verification of the crew price to remove from Regiments.</description>
