        </rule>
        <rule id="f6e2-e2bc-d280-5f2c" name="Massive Jaws" hidden="false" publicationId="7839-e5ae-5fb9-1604" page="82">
          <description>One of his four attacks is a bite causing D3 wounds with no armour saves. Reference: Lizardmen, printed p. 82.</description>
        </rule>
