      <rules>
        <rule id="fbfd-061e-5a20-4889" name="Special character" hidden="false">
          <description>Unique named selection. 102 points includes the complete listed fixed equipment, companions, powers and mounts; only separately offered options add points. Printed profiles are before magic-item bonuses unless a rule says they are already included. Special-character use requires the players’ agreement under the books’ convention.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="fd10-650a-e0a3-92dc" name="Included equipment" hidden="false">
          <description>Hand weapon; poisoned-dart blowpipe.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="ebad-089f-e9c4-e01d" name="Chameleon Skin" hidden="false" publicationId="7839-e5ae-5fb9-1604" page="83">
          <description>Enemy shooting suffers -2 To Hit. Scaly-skin save 5+, never worse than 6+ from Strength modifiers. Reference: Lizardmen, printed p. 83.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="2b2e-cc6e-3850-973c" name="Poison Dart Blowpipe" hidden="false" publicationId="7839-e5ae-5fb9-1604" page="83">
          <description>Range 12 inches, three Strength 5 shots at one target each shooting phase; no long-range penalty. Reference: Lizardmen, printed p. 83.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="179c-f15d-42e3-770b" name="Amazing Stealth" hidden="false" publicationId="7839-e5ae-5fb9-1604" page="83">
          <description>Deploy after all other deployment, anywhere more than or equal to 8 inches from enemies. May be in the open or enemy deployment zone. Reference: Lizardmen, printed p. 83.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
